# Intent Routing Contract

Canonical doc: `docs/intent-routing-contract.md`.

## Labels (must stay aligned)

`CHECK_BALANCE`, `PAY_CREDIT_CARD`, `TRANSFER_OWN_ACCOUNTS`, `TRANSFER_THIRD_PARTY`, `VIEW_CHAT_HISTORY`, `MONTHLY_EXPENSES`, `AMBIGUOUS`, `OUT_OF_SCOPE`

Sync across: `IntentLabel.kt`, JSONL datasets, `intent_heuristic.json`.

## Ownership

| Layer | Owns |
|-------|------|
| `api/intent/` (`CascadeIntentClassifier`, Woz, heuristic) | Classification — modo `auto`: heurística → Woz → heurística |
| `local/scripts/woz_client.py` | Ollama client for benchmarks |
| `BackendRouteResolver` | Intent → API route hints |
| `ChatPresentationPolicy` (backend SDUI) | Clarification, out-of-scope, support UI |

Do not duplicate classification logic in mobile — consume API/SDUI metadata.

## Before merging classifier changes

```bash
python3 local/scripts/simulate_intent_validation.py
python3 local/scripts/simulate_dialogue_validation.py
```

(Ollama must be running.)

## Unimplemented routes

Transfers return `implemented = false` — UI must not promise success; show unavailable or guide only.

## Threshold changes

Document in `docs/intent-routing-contract.md` and add/update tests in `ChatPresentationPolicyTest` or `WozResponseParserTest`.
